# Keep all text files LF in the repository and working tree. Prevents recurring
# CRLF churn when files are synced from a Windows machine (Syncthing). git
# auto-detects binary files and leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-suspenders: never EOL-normalize known binary assets, even if git's
# auto-detection misclassifies one.
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
